==Strategy==
Because the Deploy limit is 2, this makes the stage way harder than it should be. Use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] against the Otta-smack-us. When Chocolate Doge spawns in, use [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl/Pizza Cat]] to chip him down quickly.

